<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Micron Technology lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Micron Technology lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said on Tuesday it lowered its rating on the shares of Micron Technology Inc to hold from buy, because of valuation.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Jack Geraghty was not immediately available to provide further details.</p>
<p>-- Micron Technology posted third quarter earnings of $96.8 million or $0.44 per share, up from $58.2 million or $0.27 per share in the year-ago quarter.</p>
<p>-- Micron sales rose to $965 million from $771 million.</p>
<p>-- Micron Technology stock was off 5/8 at 41-1/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
